<title>USA: Pacific Greystone to merge with Lennar.</title>
<headline>Pacific Greystone to merge with Lennar.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Greystone Corp said Wednesday it plans to merge with homebuilder Lennar Corp .</p>
<p>Lennar's asset management business will be spun off prior to the merger, the companies said.  </p>
<p>Pacific Greystone shareholders will own 32 percent of the combined companies, and Lennar shareholders will own the rest, Pacific Greystone said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in the fourth quarter and is subject to approval by shareholders of both companies, it said.</p>
</text>
